(window.IND_GITA_V = window.IND_GITA_V || {})[10] = [{"v":1,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":"श्री भगवानुवाच","spp":"before","sa":"भूय एव महाबाहो शृणु मे परमं वचः ।\nयत्तेऽहं प्रीयमाणाय वक्ष्यामि हितकाम्यया ॥","iast":"bhūya eva mahābāho śṛṇu me paramaṃ vacaḥ |\nyatte’haṃ prīyamāṇāya vakṣyāmi hitakāmyayā ||","read":"bhooya eva mahaabaaho shrinu me paramam vachah |\nyatte'ham preeyamaanaaya vakshyaami hitakaamyayaa ||","spli":"śrī bhagavānuvāca","splr":"shree bhagavaanuvaacha","en":"The Blessed Lord said: Again, O mighty-armed, hear thou My supreme word, that, desiring thy welfare, I will declare to thee who art beloved.","en2":"Again, O mighty-armed, do thou listen to My supreme word, which I, wishing thy welfare, will tell thee who art delighted (to hear Me).","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":2,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"न मे विदुः सुरगणाः प्रभवं न महर्षयः ।\nअहमादिर्हि देवानां महर्षीणां च सर्वशः ॥","iast":"na me viduḥ suragaṇāḥ prabhavaṃ na maharṣayaḥ |\nahamādirhi devānāṃ maharṣīṇāṃ ca sarvaśaḥ ||","read":"na me viduh suraganaah prabhavam na maharshayah |\nahamaadirhi devaanaam maharsheenaam cha sarvashah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"The multitude of the Shining Ones, or the great Rishis, know not my forthcoming, for I am the beginning of all the Shining Ones and the great Rishis.","en2":"Neither the hosts of Devas, nor the great Rishis, know My origin, for in every way I am the source of all the Devas and the great Rishis.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":3,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यो मामजमनादिं च वेत्ति लोकमहेश्वरम् ।\nअसम्मूढः स मर्त्येषु सर्वपापैः प्रमुच्यते ॥","iast":"yo māmajamanādiṃ ca vetti lokamaheśvaram |\nasammūḍhaḥ sa martyeṣu sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate ||","read":"yo maamajamanaadim cha vetti lokamaheshvaram |\nasammoodhah sa martyeshu sarvapaapaih pramuchyate ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"He who knoweth Me, unborn, beginningless, the great Lord of the world, he among mortals without delusion, is liberated from all sin.","en2":"He who knows Me, birthless and beginningless, the great Lord of worlds—he, among mortals, is undeluded, he is freed from all sins.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":4,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"बुद्धिर्ज्ञानमसंमोहः क्षमा सत्यं दमः शमः ।\nसुखं दुःखं भवोऽभावो भयं चाभयमेव च ॥","iast":"buddhirjñānamasaṃmohaḥ kṣamā satyaṃ damaḥ śamaḥ |\nsukhaṃ duḥkhaṃ bhavo’bhāvo bhayaṃ cābhayameva ca ||","read":"buddhirjnaanamasammohah kshamaa satyam damah shamah |\nsukham duhkham bhavo'bhaavo bhayam chaabhayameva cha ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Reason, wisdom, non-illusion, forgiveness, truth, self-restraint, calmness, pleasure, pain, existence, non-existence, fear, and also courage","en2":"Intellect, knowledge, non-delusion, forbearance, truth, restraint of the external senses, calmness of heart, happiness, misery, birth, death, fear, as well as fearlessness, non-injury, evenness, contentment, austerity, benevolence, good name, (as well as) ill-fame;—(these) different kinds of qualities of beings arise from Me alone.","en2r":"10.4-5","rv":null},{"v":5,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अहिंसा समता तुष्टिस्तपो दानं यशोऽयशः ।\nभवन्ति भावा भूतानां मत्त एव पृथग्विधाः ॥","iast":"ahiṃsā samatā tuṣṭistapo dānaṃ yaśo’yaśaḥ |\nbhavanti bhāvā bhūtānāṃ matta eva pṛthagvidhāḥ ||","read":"ahimsaa samataa tushtistapo daanam yasho'yashah |\nbhavanti bhaavaa bhootaanaam matta eva prithagvidhaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Harmlessness, equanimity, content, austerity, almsgiving, fame and obloquy are the various characteristics of beings issuing from Me.","en2":"Intellect, knowledge, non-delusion, forbearance, truth, restraint of the external senses, calmness of heart, happiness, misery, birth, death, fear, as well as fearlessness, non-injury, evenness, contentment, austerity, benevolence, good name, (as well as) ill-fame;—(these) different kinds of qualities of beings arise from Me alone.","en2r":"10.4-5","rv":null},{"v":6,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"महर्षयः सप्त पूर्वे चत्वारो मनवस्तथा ।\nमद्भावा मानसा जाता येषां लोक इमाः प्रजाः ॥","iast":"maharṣayaḥ sapta pūrve catvāro manavastathā |\nmadbhāvā mānasā jātā yeṣāṃ loka imāḥ prajāḥ ||","read":"maharshayah sapta poorve chatvaaro manavastathaa |\nmadbhaavaa maanasaa jaataa yeshaam loka imaah prajaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"The seven great Rishis, the ancient Four, and also the Manus, were born of My nature, and mind; of them this race was generated.","en2":"The seven great Rishis as well as the four ancient Manus, possessed of powers like Me (due to their thoughts being fixed on Me), were born of (My) mind; from them are these creatures in the world.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":7,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"एतां विभूतिं योगं च मम यो वेत्ति तत्त्वतः ।\nसोऽविकम्पेन योगेन युज्यते नात्र संशयः ॥","iast":"etāṃ vibhūtiṃ yogaṃ ca mama yo vetti tattvataḥ |\nso’vikampena yogena yujyate nātra saṃśayaḥ ||","read":"etaam vibhootim yogam cha mama yo vetti tattvatah |\nso'vikampena yogena yujyate naatra samshayah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"He who knows in essence that sovereignty and yoga of Mine, he is harmonised by unfaltering yoga; there is no doubt thereof.","en2":"He who in reality knows these manifold manifestations of My being and (this) Yoga power of Mine, becomes established in the unshakable Yoga; there is no doubt about it.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":8,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अहं सर्वस्य प्रभवो मत्तः सर्वं प्रवर्तते ।\nइति मत्वा भजन्ते मां बुधा भावसमन्विताः ॥","iast":"ahaṃ sarvasya prabhavo mattaḥ sarvaṃ pravartate |\niti matvā bhajante māṃ budhā bhāvasamanvitāḥ ||","read":"aham sarvasya prabhavo mattah sarvam pravartate |\niti matvaa bhajante maam budhaa bhaavasamanvitaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"I am the Generator of all; all evolves from Me; understanding thus, the wise adore Me in rapt emotion.","en2":"l am the origin of all, from Me everything evolves;—thus thinking the wise worship Me with loving consciousness.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":9,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मच्चित्ता मद्गतप्राणा बोधयन्तः परस्परम् ।\nकथयन्तश्च मां नित्यं तुष्यन्ति च रमन्ति च ॥","iast":"maccittā madgataprāṇā bodhayantaḥ parasparam |\nkathayantaśca māṃ nityaṃ tuṣyanti ca ramanti ca ||","read":"machchittaa madgatapraanaa bodhayantah parasparam |\nkathayantashcha maam nityam tushyanti cha ramanti cha ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Mindful of Me, their life hidden in Me, illumining each other, ever conversing about Me, they are content and joyful.","en2":"With their minds wholly in Me, with their senses absorbed in Me, enlightening one another, and always speaking of Me, they are satisfied and delighted.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":10,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"तेषां सततयुक्तानां भजतां प्रीतिपूर्वकम् ।\nददामि बुद्धियोगं तं येन मामुपयान्ति ते ॥","iast":"teṣāṃ satatayuktānāṃ bhajatāṃ prītipūrvakam |\ndadāmi buddhiyogaṃ taṃ yena māmupayānti te ||","read":"teshaam satatayuktaanaam bhajataam preetipoorvakam |\ndadaami buddhiyogam tam yena maamupayaanti te ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"To these, ever harmonious, worshipping in love, I give the yoga of discrimination by which they come unto Me.","en2":"To them, ever steadfast and serving Me with affection, I give that Buddhi Yoga by which they come unto Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":11,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"तेषामेवानुकम्पार्थमहमज्ञानजं तमः ।\nनाशयाम्यात्मभावस्थो ज्ञानदीपेन भास्वता ॥","iast":"teṣāmevānukampārthamahamajñānajaṃ tamaḥ |\nnāśayāmyātmabhāvastho jñānadīpena bhāsvatā ||","read":"teshaamevaanukampaarthamahamajnaanajam tamah |\nnaashayaamyaatmabhaavastho jnaanadeepena bhaasvataa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Out of pure compassion for them, dwelling within their Self, I destroy the ignorance-born darkness by the shining lamp of wisdom.","en2":"Out of mere compassion for them, [paragraph continues] I, abiding in their hearts, destroy the darkness (in them) born of ignorance, by the luminous lamp of knowledge.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":12,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":"अर्जुन उवाच","spp":"before","sa":"परं ब्रह्म परं धाम पवित्रं परमं भवान् ।\nपुरुषं शाश्वतं दिव्यमादिदेवमजं विभुम् ॥","iast":"paraṃ brahma paraṃ dhāma pavitraṃ paramaṃ bhavān |\npuruṣaṃ śāśvataṃ divyamādidevamajaṃ vibhum ||","read":"param brahma param dhaama pavitram paramam bhavaan |\npurusham shaashvatam divyamaadidevamajam vibhum ||","spli":"arjuna uvāca","splr":"arjuna uvaacha","en":"Arjuna said: Thou art the supreme Eternal, the supreme Abode, the supreme Purity, eternal divine man, primeval Deity, unborn, the Lord!","en2":"The Supreme Brahman, the Supreme Abode, the Supreme Purifier, art Thou. All the Rishis, the Deva-Rishi Nârada as well as Asita, Devala and Vyâsa have declared Thee as the Eternal, the Self-luminous Purusha, the first Deva, Birth-less and All-pervading. So also Thou Thyself sayest to me.","en2r":"10.12-13","rv":null},{"v":13,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"आहुस्त्वामृषयः सर्वे देवर्षिर्नारदस्तथा ।\nअसितो देवलो व्यासः स्वयं चैव ब्रवीषि मे ॥","iast":"āhustvāmṛṣayaḥ sarve devarṣirnāradastathā |\nasito devalo vyāsaḥ svayaṃ caiva bravīṣi me ||","read":"aahustvaamrishayah sarve devarshirnaaradastathaa |\nasito devalo vyaasah svayam chaiva braveeshi me ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"All the Rishis have thus acclaimed Thee, as also the divine Rishi, Nârada; so Asita, Devala, and Vyâsa; and now Thou Thyself tellest it me.","en2":"The Supreme Brahman, the Supreme Abode, the Supreme Purifier, art Thou. All the Rishis, the Deva-Rishi Nârada as well as Asita, Devala and Vyâsa have declared Thee as the Eternal, the Self-luminous Purusha, the first Deva, Birth-less and All-pervading. So also Thou Thyself sayest to me.","en2r":"10.12-13","rv":null},{"v":14,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"सर्वमेतदृतं मन्ये यन्मां वदसि केशव ।\nन हि ते भगवन् व्यक्तिं विदुर्देवा न दानवाः ॥","iast":"sarvametadṛtaṃ manye yanmāṃ vadasi keśava |\nna hi te bhagavan vyaktiṃ vidurdevā na dānavāḥ ||","read":"sarvametadritam manye yanmaam vadasi keshava |\nna hi te bhagavan vyaktim vidurdevaa na daanavaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"All this I believe true that Thou sayest to me, O Keshava. Thy manifestation, O Blessed Lord, neither Shining Ones nor Dânavas comprehend.","en2":"I regard all this that Thou sayest to me as true, O Keshava. Verily, O Bhagavân, neither the Devas nor the Dânavas know Thy manifestation.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":15,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"स्वयमेवात्मनाऽत्मानं वेत्थ त्वं पुरुषोत्तम ।\nभूतभावन भूतेश देवदेव जगत्पते ॥","iast":"svayamevātmanā’tmānaṃ vettha tvaṃ puruṣottama |\nbhūtabhāvana bhūteśa devadeva jagatpate ||","read":"svayamevaatmanaa'tmaanam vettha tvam purushottama |\nbhootabhaavana bhootesha devadeva jagatpate ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Thyself indeed knowest Thyself by Thyself, O Purushottama; Source of beings, Lord of beings, Shining One of Shining Ones, Ruler of the world!","en2":"Verily, Thou Thyself knowest Thyself by Thyself, O Purusha Supreme, O Source of beings, O Lord of beings, O Deva of Devas, O Ruler of the world.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":16,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"वक्तुमर्हस्यशेषेण दिव्या ह्यात्मविभूतयः ।\nयाभिर्विभूतिभिर्लोकानिमांस्त्वं व्याप्य तिष्ठसि ॥","iast":"vaktumarhasyaśeṣeṇa divyā hyātmavibhūtayaḥ |\nyābhirvibhūtibhirlokānimāṃstvaṃ vyāpya tiṣṭhasi ||","read":"vaktumarhasyasheshena divyaa hyaatmavibhootayah |\nyaabhirvibhootibhirlokaanimaamstvam vyaapya tishthasi ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Deign to tell without reserve of Thine own divine glories, by which glories Thou remainest, pervading these worlds.","en2":"Thou shouldst indeed speak, without reserve, of Thy divine attributes by which, filling all these worlds, Thou existest.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":17,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"कथं विद्यामहं योगिंस्त्वां सदा परिचिन्तयन् ।\nकेषु केषु च भावेषु चिन्त्योऽसि भगवन्मया ॥","iast":"kathaṃ vidyāmahaṃ yogiṃstvāṃ sadā paricintayan |\nkeṣu keṣu ca bhāveṣu cintyo’si bhagavanmayā ||","read":"katham vidyaamaham yogimstvaam sadaa parichintayan |\nkeshu keshu cha bhaaveshu chintyo'si bhagavanmayaa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"How may I know thee, O Yogi, by constant meditation? In what, in what aspects art Thou to be thought of by me, O blessed Lord?","en2":"How shall I, O Yogin, meditate ever to know Thee? In what things, Bhagavân, art Thou to be thought of by me?","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":18,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"विस्तरेणात्मनो योगं विभूतिं च जनार्दन ।\nभूयः कथय तृप्तिर्हि शृण्वतो नास्ति मेऽमृतम् ॥","iast":"vistareṇātmano yogaṃ vibhūtiṃ ca janārdana |\nbhūyaḥ kathaya tṛptirhi śṛṇvato nāsti me’mṛtam ||","read":"vistarenaatmano yogam vibhootim cha janaardana |\nbhooyah kathaya triptirhi shrinvato naasti me'mritam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"In detail tell me again of Thy yoga and glory, O Janardana; for me there is never satiety in hearing thy life-giving words.","en2":"Speak to me again in detail, Jnanârdana, of Thy Yoga-powers and attributes; for I am never satiated in hearing the ambrosia (of Thy speech).","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":19,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":"श्री भगवानुवाच","spp":"before","sa":"हन्त ते कथयिष्यामि दिव्या ह्यात्मविभूतयः ।\nप्राधान्यतः कुरुश्रेष्ठ नास्त्यन्तो विस्तरस्य मे ॥","iast":"hanta te kathayiṣyāmi divyā hyātmavibhūtayaḥ |\nprādhānyataḥ kuruśreṣṭha nāstyanto vistarasya me ||","read":"hanta te kathayishyaami divyaa hyaatmavibhootayah |\npraadhaanyatah kurushreshtha naastyanto vistarasya me ||","spli":"śrī bhagavānuvāca","splr":"shree bhagavaanuvaacha","en":"The Blessed Lord said: Blessed be thou! I will declare to thee My divine glory by its chief characteristics, O best of the Kurus; there is no end to details of Me.","en2":"I shall speak to thee now, O best of the Kurus, of My divine attributes, according to their prominence; there is no end to the particulars of My manifestation.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":20,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अहमात्मा गुडाकेश सर्वभूताशयस्थितः ।\nअहमादिश्च मध्यं च भूतानामन्त एव च ॥","iast":"ahamātmā guḍākeśa sarvabhūtāśayasthitaḥ |\nahamādiśca madhyaṃ ca bhūtānāmanta eva ca ||","read":"ahamaatmaa gudaakesha sarvabhootaashayasthitah |\nahamaadishcha madhyam cha bhootaanaamanta eva cha ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"I, O Gudakesha, am the Self, seated in the heart of all beings; I am the beginning, the middle, and also the end of all beings.","en2":"I am the Self, O Gudâkesha, existent in the heart of all beings; I am the beginning, the middle, and also the end of all beings.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":21,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"आदित्यानामहं विष्णुर्ज्योतिषां रविरंशुमान् ।\nमरीचिर्मरुतामस्मि नक्षत्राणामहं शशी ॥","iast":"ādityānāmahaṃ viṣṇurjyotiṣāṃ raviraṃśumān |\nmarīcirmarutāmasmi nakṣatrāṇāmahaṃ śaśī ||","read":"aadityaanaamaham vishnurjyotishaam raviramshumaan |\nmareechirmarutaamasmi nakshatraanaamaham shashee ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of the Adityas I am Vishnu; of radiances the glorious sun; I am Marîchi of the Maruts; of the asterisms the Moon am I.","en2":"Of the Adityas, I am Vishnu; of luminaries, the radiant Sun; of the winds, I am Marichi; of the asterisms, the Moon.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":22,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"वेदानां सामवेदोऽस्मि देवानामस्मि वासवः ।\nइन्द्रियाणां मनश्चास्मि भूतानामस्मि चेतना ॥","iast":"vedānāṃ sāmavedo’smi devānāmasmi vāsavaḥ |\nindriyāṇāṃ manaścāsmi bhūtānāmasmi cetanā ||","read":"vedaanaam saamavedo'smi devaanaamasmi vaasavah |\nindriyaanaam manashchaasmi bhootaanaamasmi chetanaa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of the Vedas I am the Sâma-Veda; I am Vâsava of the Shining Ones; and of the senses I am the mind; I am of living beings the intelligence.","en2":"I am the Sâma-Veda of the Vedas, and Vâsava (Indra) of the gods; of the senses I am Manas, and intelligence in living beings am I.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":23,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"रुद्राणां शङ्करश्चास्मि वित्तेशो यक्षरक्षसाम् ।\nवसूनां पावकश्चास्मि मेरुः शिखरिणामहम् ॥","iast":"rudrāṇāṃ śaṅkaraścāsmi vitteśo yakṣarakṣasām |\nvasūnāṃ pāvakaścāsmi meruḥ śikhariṇāmaham ||","read":"rudraanaam shankarashchaasmi vittesho yaksharakshasaam |\nvasoonaam paavakashchaasmi meruh shikharinaamaham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"And of the Rudras Shañkara am I; Vittesha of the Yakshas and Râkshasas; and of the Vasus I am Pâvaka; Meru of high mountains am I.","en2":"And of the Rudras I am Sankara, of the Yakshas and Râkshasas the Lord of wealth (Kuvera), of the Vasus I am Pâvaka, and of mountains, Meru am I.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":24,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"पुरोधसां च मुख्यं मां विद्धि पार्थ बृहस्पतिम् ।\nसेनानीनामहं स्कन्दः सरसामस्मि सागरः ॥","iast":"purodhasāṃ ca mukhyaṃ māṃ viddhi pārtha bṛhaspatim |\nsenānīnāmahaṃ skandaḥ sarasāmasmi sāgaraḥ ||","read":"purodhasaam cha mukhyam maam viddhi paartha brihaspatim |\nsenaaneenaamaham skandah sarasaamasmi saagarah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"And know Me, O Pârtha, of household priests the chief, Brihaspati: of generals I am Skanda; of lakes I am the ocean.","en2":"And of priests, O son of Prithâ, know Me the chief, Brihaspati; of generals, I am Skanda; of bodies of water, I am the ocean.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":25,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"महर्षीणां भृगुरहं गिरामस्म्येकमक्षरम् ।\nयज्ञानां जपयज्ञोऽस्मि स्थावराणां हिमालयः ॥","iast":"maharṣīṇāṃ bhṛgurahaṃ girāmasmyekamakṣaram |\nyajñānāṃ japayajño’smi sthāvarāṇāṃ himālayaḥ ||","read":"maharsheenaam bhriguraham giraamasmyekamaksharam |\nyajnaanaam japayajno'smi sthaavaraanaam himaalayah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of the great Rishis Bhṛigu; of speech I am the one syllable; of sacrifices I am the sacrifice of silent repetitions; of immovable things the Himâlaya.","en2":"Of the great Rishis I am Bhrigu; of words I am the one syllable \"Om\"; of Yajnas I am the Yajna of Japa (silent repetition); of immovable things the Himâlaya.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":26,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अश्वत्थः सर्ववृक्षाणां देवर्षीणां च नारदः ।\nगन्धर्वाणां चित्ररथः सिद्धानां कपिलो मुनिः ॥","iast":"aśvatthaḥ sarvavṛkṣāṇāṃ devarṣīṇāṃ ca nāradaḥ |\ngandharvāṇāṃ citrarathaḥ siddhānāṃ kapilo muniḥ ||","read":"ashvatthah sarvavrikshaanaam devarsheenaam cha naaradah |\ngandharvaanaam chitrarathah siddhaanaam kapilo munih ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Asvattha of all tree; and of divine Rishis Nârada; of Gandharvas Chitraratha; of the perfected the Muni Kapila.","en2":"Of all trees (I am) the Ashvattha, and Nârada of Deva-Rishis; Chitraratha of Gandharvas am I, and the Muni Kapila of the perfected ones.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":27,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"उच्चैःश्रवसमश्वानां विद्धि माममृतोद्भवम् ।\nऐरावतं गजेन्द्राणां नराणां च नराधिपम् ॥","iast":"uccaiḥśravasamaśvānāṃ viddhi māmamṛtodbhavam |\nairāvataṃ gajendrāṇāṃ narāṇāṃ ca narādhipam ||","read":"uchchaihshravasamashvaanaam viddhi maamamritodbhavam |\nairaavatam gajendraanaam naraanaam cha naraadhipam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Uchchaishravas of horses know me, nectar-born; Airâvata of lordly elephants, and of men the Monarch.","en2":"Know Me among horses as Uchchaisshravas, Amrita-born; of lordly elephants Airâvata, and of men the king.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":28,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"आयुधानामहं वज्रं धेनूनामस्मि कामधुक् ।\nप्रजनश्चास्मि कन्दर्पः सर्पाणामस्मि वासुकिः ॥","iast":"āyudhānāmahaṃ vajraṃ dhenūnāmasmi kāmadhuk |\nprajanaścāsmi kandarpaḥ sarpāṇāmasmi vāsukiḥ ||","read":"aayudhaanaamaham vajram dhenoonaamasmi kaamadhuk |\nprajanashchaasmi kandarpah sarpaanaamasmi vaasukih ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of weapons I am the thunderbolt; of cows I am Kâmadhuk; I am Kandarpa of the progenitors; of serpents Vâsuki am I.","en2":"Of weapons I am the thunderbolt, of cows I am Kâmadhuk; I am the Kandarpa, the cause of offspring; of serpents I am Vâsuki.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":29,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अनन्तश्चास्मि नागानां वरुणो यादसामहम् ।\nपितॄणामर्यमा चास्मि यमः संयमतामहम् ॥","iast":"anantaścāsmi nāgānāṃ varuṇo yādasāmaham |\npitṝṇāmaryamā cāsmi yamaḥ saṃyamatāmaham ||","read":"anantashchaasmi naagaanaam varuno yaadasaamaham |\npitreenaamaryamaa chaasmi yamah samyamataamaham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"And I am Ananta of Nâgas, Varuna of sea-dwellers I; and of ancestors Aryaman; Yama of governors am I.","en2":"And Ananta of snakes I am, I am Varuna of water-beings; and Aryaman of Pitris I am, I am Yama of controllers.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":30,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"प्रह्लादश्चास्मि दैत्यानां कालः कलयतामहम् ।\nमृगाणां च मृगेन्द्रोऽहं वैनतेयश्च पक्षिणाम् ॥","iast":"prahlādaścāsmi daityānāṃ kālaḥ kalayatāmaham |\nmṛgāṇāṃ ca mṛgendro’haṃ vainateyaśca pakṣiṇām ||","read":"prahlaadashchaasmi daityaanaam kaalah kalayataamaham |\nmrigaanaam cha mrigendro'ham vainateyashcha pakshinaam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"And I am Prahlâda of Daityas; of calculators Time am I; and of wild beasts I the imperial beast; and Vainateya of birds.","en2":"And Prahlâda am I of Diti's progeny, of measurers I am Time; and of beasts I am the lord of beasts, and Garuda of birds.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":31,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"पवनः पवतामस्मि रामः शस्त्रभृतामहम् ।\nझषाणां मकरश्चास्मि स्रोतसामस्मि जाह्नवी ॥","iast":"pavanaḥ pavatāmasmi rāmaḥ śastrabhṛtāmaham |\njhaṣāṇāṃ makaraścāsmi srotasāmasmi jāhnavī ||","read":"pavanah pavataamasmi raamah shastrabhritaamaham |\njhashaanaam makarashchaasmi srotasaamasmi jaahnavee ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of purifiers I am the wind; Rama of warriors I; and I am Makara of fishes; of streams the Gangâ am I.","en2":"Of purifiers I am the wind, Râma of warriors am I; of fishes I am the shark, of streams I am Jâhnavi (the Ganges).","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":32,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"सर्गाणामादिरन्तश्च मध्यं चैवाहमर्जुन ।\nअध्यात्मविद्या विद्यानां वादः प्रवदतामहम् ॥","iast":"sargāṇāmādirantaśca madhyaṃ caivāhamarjuna |\nadhyātmavidyā vidyānāṃ vādaḥ pravadatāmaham ||","read":"sargaanaamaadirantashcha madhyam chaivaahamarjuna |\nadhyaatmavidyaa vidyaanaam vaadah pravadataamaham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of creations the beginning and the ending, and also the middle am I, O Arjuna. Of sciences the science concerning the Self; the speech of orators I.","en2":"Of manifestations I, am the beginning, the middle and also the end; of all knowledges I am the knowledge of the Self, and Vâda of disputants.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":33,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अक्षराणामकारोऽस्मि द्वन्द्वः सामासिकस्य च ।\nअहमेवाक्षयः कालो धाताऽहं विश्वतोमुखः ॥","iast":"akṣarāṇāmakāro’smi dvandvaḥ sāmāsikasya ca |\nahamevākṣayaḥ kālo dhātā’haṃ viśvatomukhaḥ ||","read":"aksharaanaamakaaro'smi dvandvah saamaasikasya cha |\nahamevaakshayah kaalo dhaataa'ham vishvatomukhah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of letters the letter A I am, and the duality of a compound; I also everlasting Time; I the Supporter, whose face turns everywhere.","en2":"Of letters the letter A am I, and Dvandva of all compounds; I alone am the inexhaustible Time, I the Sustainer (by dispensing fruits of actions) All-formed.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":34,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मृत्युः सर्वहरश्चाहमुद्भवश्च भविष्यताम् ।\nकीर्तिः श्रीर्वाक्च नारीणां स्मृतिर्मेधा धृतिः क्षमा ॥","iast":"mṛtyuḥ sarvaharaścāhamudbhavaśca bhaviṣyatām |\nkīrtiḥ śrīrvākca nārīṇāṃ smṛtirmedhā dhṛtiḥ kṣamā ||","read":"mrityuh sarvaharashchaahamudbhavashcha bhavishyataam |\nkeertih shreervaakcha naareenaam smritirmedhaa dhritih kshamaa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"And all-devouring Death am I, and the origin of all to come; and of feminine qualities, fame, prosperity, speech, memory, intelligence, constancy, forgiveness.","en2":"And I am the all-seizing Death, and the prosperity of those who are to be prosperous; of the feminine qualities (I am) Fame, Prosperity (or beauty), Inspiration, Memory, Intelligence, Constancy and Forbearance.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":35,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"बृहत्साम तथा साम्नां गायत्री छन्दसामहम् ।\nमासानां मार्गशीर्षोऽहमृतूनां कुसुमाकरः ॥","iast":"bṛhatsāma tathā sāmnāṃ gāyatrī chandasāmaham |\nmāsānāṃ mārgaśīrṣo’hamṛtūnāṃ kusumākaraḥ ||","read":"brihatsaama tathaa saamnaam gaayatree chhandasaamaham |\nmaasaanaam maargasheersho'hamritoonaam kusumaakarah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of hymns also Brihatsâman; Gâyatrî of metres am I; of months I am Mârgasîrsha; of seasons the flowery.","en2":"Of Sâmas also I am the Brihat-Sâma, of metres Gâyatri am I; of months I am Mârgashirsha, of seasons the flowery season.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":36,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"द्यूतं छलयतामस्मि तेजस्तेजस्विनामहम् ।\nजयोऽस्मि व्यवसायोऽस्मि सत्त्वं सत्त्ववतामहम् ॥","iast":"dyūtaṃ chalayatāmasmi tejastejasvināmaham |\njayo’smi vyavasāyo’smi sattvaṃ sattvavatāmaham ||","read":"dyootam chhalayataamasmi tejastejasvinaamaham |\njayo'smi vyavasaayo'smi sattvam sattvavataamaham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"I am the gambling of the cheat, and the splendour of splendid things I; I am victory, I am determination, and the truth of the truthful I.","en2":"I am the gambling of the fraudulent, I am the power of the powerful; I am victory, I am effort, I am Sattva of the Sâttvika.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":37,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"वृष्णीनां वासुदेवोऽस्मि पाण्डवानां धनंजयः ।\nमुनीनामप्यहं व्यासः कवीनामुशना कविः ॥","iast":"vṛṣṇīnāṃ vāsudevo’smi pāṇḍavānāṃ dhanaṃjayaḥ |\nmunīnāmapyahaṃ vyāsaḥ kavīnāmuśanā kaviḥ ||","read":"vrishneenaam vaasudevo'smi paandavaanaam dhanamjayah |\nmuneenaamapyaham vyaasah kaveenaamushanaa kavih ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of the Vṛishnis Vâsudeva am I; of the Pândavas Dhananjaya; of the Sages also I am Vyâsa; of poets Ushanâ the Bard.","en2":"Of the Vrishnis I am Vâsudeva; of the Pândavas, Dhananjaya; and also of the Munis I am Vyâsa; of the sages, Ushanas the sage.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":38,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"दण्डो दमयतामस्मि नीतिरस्मि जिगीषताम् ।\nमौनं चैवास्मि गुह्यानां ज्ञानं ज्ञानवतामहम् ॥","iast":"daṇḍo damayatāmasmi nītirasmi jigīṣatām |\nmaunaṃ caivāsmi guhyānāṃ jñānaṃ jñānavatāmaham ||","read":"dando damayataamasmi neetirasmi jigeeshataam |\nmaunam chaivaasmi guhyaanaam jnaanam jnaanavataamaham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Of rulers I am the sceptre; of those that seek victory I am statesmanship; and of secrets I am also silence; the knowledge of knowers am I.","en2":"Of punishers I am the sceptre; of those who seek to conquer, I am statesmanship; and also of things secret I am silence, and the knowledge of knowers am I.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":39,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यच्चापि सर्वभूतानां बीजं तदहमर्जुन ।\nन तदस्ति विना यत्स्यान्मया भूतं चराचरम् ॥","iast":"yaccāpi sarvabhūtānāṃ bījaṃ tadahamarjuna |\nna tadasti vinā yatsyānmayā bhūtaṃ carācaram ||","read":"yachchaapi sarvabhootaanaam beejam tadahamarjuna |\nna tadasti vinaa yatsyaanmayaa bhootam charaacharam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"And whatsoever is the seed of all beings, that am I, O Arjuna; nor is there aught, moving or unmoving, that may exist bereft of Me.","en2":"And whatsoever is the seed of all beings, that also am I, O Arjuna. There is no being, whether moving or unmoving, that can exist without Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":40,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"नान्तोऽस्ति मम दिव्यानां विभूतीनां परंतप ।\nएष तूद्देशतः प्रोक्तो विभूतेर्विस्तरो मया ॥","iast":"nānto’sti mama divyānāṃ vibhūtīnāṃ paraṃtapa |\neṣa tūddeśataḥ prokto vibhūtervistaro mayā ||","read":"naanto'sti mama divyaanaam vibhooteenaam paramtapa |\nesha tooddeshatah prokto vibhootervistaro mayaa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"There is no end of My divine powers, O Parantapa. What has been declared is illustrative of My infinite glory.","en2":"There is no end of My divine attributes, O scorcher of foes; but this is a brief statement by Me of the particulars of My divine attributes.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":41,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यद्यद्विभूतिमत्सत्त्वं श्रीमदूर्जितमेव वा ।\nतत्तदेवावगच्छ त्वं मम तेजोंऽशसंभवम् ॥","iast":"yadyadvibhūtimatsattvaṃ śrīmadūrjitameva vā |\ntattadevāvagaccha tvaṃ mama tejoṃ’śasaṃbhavam ||","read":"yadyadvibhootimatsattvam shreemadoorjitameva vaa |\ntattadevaavagachchha tvam mama tejom'shasambhavam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Whatsoever is glorious, good, beautiful, and mighty, understand thou that to go forth from a fragment of My splendour.","en2":"Whatever being there is great, prosperous or powerful, that know thou to be a product of a part of My splendour.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":42,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अथवा बहुनैतेन किं ज्ञातेन तवार्जुन ।\nविष्टभ्याहमिदं कृत्स्नमेकांशेन स्थितो जगत् ॥","iast":"athavā bahunaitena kiṃ jñātena tavārjuna |\nviṣṭabhyāhamidaṃ kṛtsnamekāṃśena sthito jagat ||","read":"athavaa bahunaitena kim jnaatena tavaarjuna |\nvishtabhyaahamidam kritsnamekaamshena sthito jagat ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"But what is the knowledge of all these details to thee, O Arjuna? Having pervaded this whole universe with one fragment of Myself, I remain.","en2":"Or what avails thee to know all this diversity, O Arjuna? (Know thou this,. that) I exist, supporting this whole world by a portion of Myself.","en2r":null,"rv":null}];
